<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Library Management System</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="public/style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <h1>📚 Library Management System</h1>

    <h3>Welcome to the Library Management System</h3>

    <p>
        Here you can manage all the books in the library.
        You can add new books, view all books, update book details,
        delete books, and search for a book easily.
    </p>

    <br>

    <a href="http://localhost:3000/getdata">📖 View All Books</a>

    <br><br>

    <a href="http://localhost:3000/insertdata">➕ Add New Book</a>

    <br><br>

    <form action="/search" method="GET">
        <input type="text" name="keyword" placeholder="Search Book by Title">
        <button type="submit">Search</button>
    </form>

</body>

</html>
